          <div class="max-w-450">
            <div class="relative flex justify-center">
              <h1 class="services-highlight">TIPS FOR ONLINE PRESENCE</h1><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Vector-2_1.svg" alt="" class="vector-bg">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="max-w-498">
            <p>Cardiologists have more online potential than almost any other clinical specialism, and your peers are already listening.</p>
            <p>We&#x27;ve created a set of tips across five areas to help you use that potential. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
